From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:51:29 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 089/100] Unified: automatic fixes in the design check, and no
 side effects

- Problems that have a clear fix carry one: redundant, conflicting (the last
  added) and malformed constraints are deleted, a floating part is moved
  onto the nearest part, the smaller of two overlapping parts is moved the
  shortest way out, an empty drawing view is deleted. fix() and fix_all();
  main(path, fix=True) saves the fixed file.
- The check no longer solves sketches: solve() touched every sketch and the
  steps after it, so each check marked the document modified.
- run() returns an Issues list that carries the ignored count, instead of an
  attribute on the function.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
